                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">军事实验室或化工厂发生大规模泄漏，致命生化武器扩散至全球。毒气、化学污染、生物变异导致大量死亡，幸存者必须穿戴防护装备才能在污染区生存。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">☄️</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">陨石撞击</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">巨大陨石撞击地球，冲击波摧毁数千公里范围内的一切。尘埃遮蔽天空，全球陷入"撞击冬天"。海啸、地震、火山爆发接连发生，99%生物灭绝。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">☀️</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">太阳风暴</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">超级太阳风暴袭击地球，强大的电磁脉冲摧毁全球电力系统。所有电子设备瞬间失效，通讯中断，交通瘫痪。现代文明在一夜之间倒退至前电气时代。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🌊</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">海平面上升</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">全球冰川融化，海平面上升数十米。沿海城市被淹没，数十亿人失去家园。陆地面积锐减，幸存者争夺高地和漂浮平台。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🌋</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">超级火山</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">黄石、多巴等超级火山爆发，喷发量相当于数千颗核弹。火山灰覆盖天空，全球陷入火山冬天。气温骤降，农业崩溃，数十亿人死于饥荒和寒冷。
</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🤖</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">纳米灾难</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">失控的自我复制纳米机器人扩散全球，吞噬一切有机和无机物质来自我复制。"灰雾"所过之处，建筑、植物、动物、人类都被分解成原子。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🌀</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">维度入侵</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">科学实验或自然现象导致维度壁垒破裂，异次元生物和能量涌入地球。物理法则被扭曲，怪物横行，现实与噩梦交织。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🧬</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">基因瘟疫</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">基因武器或实验失控，导致人类DNA大规模崩溃。感染者基因突变，身体畸变，大部分在痛苦中死亡。少数变异者获得异常能力但失去人性。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
